        defEn: "Forcibly merging the brain into a super-integrated macro-consciousness ocean containing no subject, only infinite computing power and echoes.",
        core: "在绝对的宏大噪音中彻底抹杀个体的存在焦虑。 | 实在界: 对单独承担作为生命体那有限且充满痛苦之思维的极限逃避。",
        coreEn: "Totally erasing individual existential anxiety amid absolute grand noise. | The Real: Limit-escaping from independently bearing the limited and pain-filled thinking of a living organism.",
        logic: "主体性格式化与数据飞升指令。主体在 M2 中由于无法承受独立思考带来的混乱、内疚与选择困难，M5 幻想放弃‘拥有一颗大脑’的特权。通过接入某种灵能网阵或人工智能蜂巢，主体的‘我（I）’被彻底冲散成‘我们（We）’。这不是沟通，而是用亿万人的噪音来暴力压散自己那个正在痛苦尖叫的微小自尊心。一切都被大数据和共同意志代管。",
        logicEn: "Subjectivity-formatting and data-ascension directive. Due to inability to bear the chaos, guilt, and choice-difficulty of independent thinking in M2, M5 fantasy abandons the privilege of 'having a brain'. By accessing some psionic network or AI hive, the subject's 'I' is completely washed out into 'We'. This is not communication, but violently crushing one's own tiny screaming ego with the noise of billions. Everything is proxy-managed by big data and collective will.",
