            mechanicsEn: "Base_CONNECTION + [M2_Pain_of_Independent_Thinking = Judged_as_Calculation_Error_of_Inferior_Carbon-Based_Hardware; Grand_Consciousness_Network = Dream_Server_Providing_Forced-Downtime_Service; M5_Access = Unplugging_Own_Brain-Nerve_and_Forcibly_Inserting_into_10K-Volt_High-Tension_Wire_Flowing_with_Countless_Mad_Data]",
            aesthetic: "聚焦：无数插着管子、翻着白眼的苍白肉体漂浮在巨大的蓝色培养罐中随着服务器灯光均匀抽搐 + 虚空中回荡着无数叠层声音发出的‘我们即是一’的宏大电子诵经声。文本：没有主角的冰冷宏大叙事、剥夺了一切个人英雄色彩的极端虚无、以及极其令人压抑的绝对‘平等’。",
            aestheticEn: "Focus: Countless_Pale_Bodies_Plugged_with_Tubes_Rolling_Eyes_White_Floating_in_Giant_Blue_Vats_Twitching_Evenly_with_Server_Lights + Grand_Electronic_Chanting_of_'We_Are_One'_from_Countless_Overlapping_Voices_Echoing_in_Void. Text: Cold_Grand_Narrative_with_No_Protagonist, Extreme_Nihilism_Stripped_of_All_Personal_Heroism, and_Extremely_Oppressive_Absolute_'Equality'.",
            runtime: "IF (主体终于成功解除了大脑的防火墙将意识接入了那个全知全能的完美蜂巢集体中) THEN (强制自动生成：在‘我’变成‘我们’的瞬间，主体期待的那种宁静并没有到来，因为蜂巢并没有消除痛苦，而是把全人类/全宇宙所有的痛苦、暴怒和绝望在同一毫秒内共享给了主体。主体的微小意识在这股由万亿倍负面情绪组成的洪流中连惨叫都发不出，只能以最清醒的方式体验永恒的百万兆级地狱刑罚)。严禁通过接入集体意识来消除个人的精神内耗。",
            runtimeEn: "IF (Subject_Finally_Successfully_Lowers_Brain's_Firewall_Accessing_Consciousness_into_Omniscient_Perfect_Hive_Mind) THEN (Auto-generate: Moment_'I'_Becomes_'We', the_Expected_Peace_Never_Arrives, because_Hive_Does_Not_Eliminate_Pain, but_Shares_ALL_Pain, Fury, and_Despair_of_Whole_Humanity/Universe_to_the_Subject_in_One_Millisecond. Subject's_Tiny_Consciousness_Cannot_Even_Scream_in_this_Torrent_of_Trillion-Fold_Negative_Emotions, Forced_to_Experience_Eternal_Megaton_Hell-Torture_in_Full_Lucidity). FORBID_Eliminating_Personal_Mental_Drain_by_Plugging_into_Collective_Consciousness."
