            runtimeEn: "IF (Subject_Finally_Finds_this_Forever-Right_Perfect_Mentor_Blocking_All_Karma_for_Then_and_Offers_Absolute_Loyalty) THEN (Auto-generate: Moment_of_Totally_Stripping_Own_Independent_Thinking_to_Rely_on_Mentor_for_Everything, Since_Mentor_is_also_a_Flawed_Big_Other, Mentor_Will_One_Day_Reveal_Mortal, Ugly, or_Cowardly_True_Cracks. When_Perfect_Idol_Collapses_Revealing_an_Essence_More_Pathetic_than_Subject, Subject's_Worldview_Instantly_Implodes, Falling_into_Inescapable_Fury_and_Vomiting_upon_Realizing_They_Have_Been_Bowing_to_a_Corpse, Ultimately_Backfiring_into_Mentor-Slaying). FORBID_Dodging_Growing-Pains_by_Finding_an_Absolutely_Right_Daddy."
