        name: "被理解", nameEn: "Understanding",
        group: "C. 连接与融合", groupEn: "Connection",
        def: "渴望一个能够免去所有语言沟通、毫无偏差地读取并接纳自己所有下意识和黑暗面的终极监控者。",
        defEn: "Craving an ultimate monitor capable of exempting all verbal communication, reading and accepting all one's subconscious and dark sides without any deviation.",
