            aestheticEn: "Focus: A_Wordless_Mute_Full_of_Resentment_and_Grievance_Waiting_in_Dark_for_the_Blind_yet_Omniscient_Prophet_to_Stroke_Their_Head_and_Say_'I_Know' + Zero_Air_Vibration_Between_Them_yet_Suffocating_Oppressive_Information-Flow. Text: Extreme_Disgust_toward_Language_Itself, Absolute_Exposure-Sense_like_being_Stripped_and_Sliced_by_Higher-Dimensional_Beings, and_Despicable_Pretentious_Craving_to_be_Seen-Through.",
            runtime: "IF (主体终于找到了这个能完全读懂自己且无需自己说一句话的完美读心者) THEN (强制自动生成：在被‘完全看透’的瞬间，主体的所有防御机制全部失效，所有下意识里连自己都不敢面对的乱伦冲动、极度自私、暴虐残忍，都在光天化日之下被对方静静地注视着。主体期待的‘原来你这么好’并没有发生，对方因为承载了主体所有的黑暗而瞬间发疯或由于其看垃圾般的平静眼神。主体在绝对透明的恐怖中发现了自己的灵魂其实只是一堆散发着恶臭的代码，瞬间崩溃羞愤自尽)。严禁通过寻找完美读心者来免除精神表达的磨难。",
            runtimeEn: "IF (Subject_Finally_Finds_this_Perfect_Mind-Reader_Who_Can_Read_Them_Completely_Without_a_Word) THEN (Auto-generate: Moment_Being_'Totally_Seen_Through', Subject's_All_Defense_Mechanisms_Fail; All_Incestuous_Urges, Extreme_Selfishness, and_Tyrannical_Cruelty_They_Themselves_Fear_to_Face_Subconsciously_are_Quietly_Stared_at_by_Partner_in_Broad_Daylight. Subject's_Expected_'Wow_You_Are_So_Good'_Never_Happens; Partner_Instantly_Goes_Mad_Bearing_All_Darkness_or_Show_Calm_Eyes_like_Looking_at_Trash. Subject_Discovers_in_Terror_of_Absolute_Transparency_that_Their_Soul_is_Just_a_Pile_of_Stinking_Code, Instantly_Breaking_Down_and_Committing_Suicide_in_Shame/Fury). FORBID_Exempting_Tribulations_of_Mental_Expression_by_Seeking_Perfect_Mind-Reader."
